[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theskumar/python-dotenv/pulls/700","id":4515045389,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAWoOrs8AAAABDR4gDQ","html_url":"https://github.com/theskumar/python-dotenv/pull/700","diff_url":"https://github.com/theskumar/python-dotenv/pull/700.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/theskumar/python-dotenv/pull/700.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theskumar/python-dotenv/issues/700","number":700,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix dotenv get exiting with code 1 for empty string values","user":{"login":"ShamikOfficial","id":51356328,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzU2MzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51356328?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShamikOfficial","html_url":"https://github.com/ShamikOfficial","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShamikOfficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShamikOfficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShamikOfficial/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShamikOfficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShamikOfficial/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShamikOfficial/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShamikOfficial/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShamikOfficial/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShamikOfficial/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #699.\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\n`dotenv get KEY` uses `if stored_value:` so an empty string is treated as missing and the command exits with code 1 — the same as an absent key.\r\n\r\n```python\r\n>>> from dotenv import set_key, get_key\r\n>>> set_key(\".env\", \"EMPTY\", \"\")\r\n>>> get_key(\".env\", \"EMPTY\")   # library API is fine\r\n''\r\n>>> # dotenv get EMPTY  -> exit code 1\r\n```\r\n\r\nEmpty values (`KEY=` / `KEY=\"\"`) are valid; only the CLI was wrong.\r\n\r\n## Fix\r\n\r\nExit only when the key is absent or the stored value is `None` (bare key with no value). Empty strings are echoed and exit 0.\r\n\r\n## Tests\r\n\r\n- New `test_get_empty_string_value` pins exit code 0 and a blank line of output for `a=`.\r\n- Existing get tests still pass.\r\n\r\n`pytest tests/test_cli.py::test_get_existing_value tests/test_cli.py::test_get_empty_string_value tests/test_cli.py::test_get_non_existent_value` — 3 passed.\r\n","created_at":"2026-09-12T19:32:30Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T05:34:46Z","closed_at":"2026-10-01T05:34:45Z","merged_at":"2026-10-01T05:34:45Z","merge_commit_sha":"f215c0274dc4c310e5ca5feb4c6bddade25ece21","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theskumar/python-dotenv/pulls/700/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theskumar/python-dotenv/pulls/700/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theskumar/python-dotenv/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theskumar/python-dotenv/issues/700/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/theskumar/python-dotenv/statuses/004b454e37f415ed7828ed4c9426816d8c1b608f","head":{"label":"ShamikOfficial:fix/cli-get-empty-value","ref":"fix/cli-get-empty-value","sha":"004b454e37f415ed7828ed4c9426816d8c1b608f","user":{"login":"ShamikOfficial","id":51356328,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMzU2MzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51356328?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShamikOfficial","html_url":"https://github.com/ShamikOfficial","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShamikOfficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShamikOfficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShamikOfficial/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShamikOfficial/starred{/owner}{/r